WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:06.049
In 2019, Dr. Lunvey placed one bowl of generic
brand macaroni and cheese sauce into the Clockworks,

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:08.160
and turned it to the “Fine” setting.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.150
The result was one bowl of Fettuccine Alfredo,
which appeared to be whispering “eat me.”

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.559
Dr. Lunvey noted, “Very funny, 914.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:16.660
I'm lactose intolerant.”

